              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LIZZ0111"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very good, tastes like summer.\r\n\r\nI doubled the amount of mandarian oranges and added the sunflower seeds all throughout the recipe to increase the \"crunch.\" Tastes great. Regarding the oranges, I also sliced each peice in two so there was more peices of fruit throughout!",
            "datePublished": "2004-12-17T05:59:13.403Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "THADANDBRANDI"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I am not sure if I would call this the BEST, but it was pretty good and a definite change of pace from normal broccoli salad. I found that it tasted best if I could get a piece of fruit and veggie in my mouth at the same time, so next time I will make sure the veggies are in smaller pieces. I didn't have sunflower seeds, but added some walnuts for cruch.",
            "datePublished": "2003-05-12T16:08:30.467Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "fabeveryday"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Super easy and kid-friendly! I used nonfat Catalina dressing for even less guilt, and the flavor was great!",
            "datePublished": "2017-01-07T19:14:59.870Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
